{
    "title": "Solitaire Dragons",
    "description": "\ud83d\udd25 Prepare to be blown away by Solitaire Dragons, the most <b>fiery and legendary</b> solitaire card game in town! Get ready for a thrilling adventure as you embark on a quest to collect a variety of scorching dragons\ud83d\udc09 and create magical habitats for them.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f<b>IGNITE YOUR IMAGINATION</b>\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5EXPLOSIVE SOLITAIRE GAMEPLAY\r\nBased on the classic solitaire, we've spiced it up with a sizzling twist! Dive into a world of flaming dragons and unlock the unique chest that will leave you breathless!\ud83c\udf81\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0bBLAZING DRAGON THEMES\r\nWhile conquering challenging solitaire games, you'll be transported to a realm of awe-inspiring dragon habitats, filled with majestic creatures and breathtaking landscapes.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc32COUNTLESS ADVENTURES AWAIT\r\nPrepare yourself for endless excitement with Daily Challenges\ud83c\udccf. Brace yourself for tens of thousands of captivating solitaire challenges, available anytime and anywhere!\r\n\r\n\u2728MAGICAL BOOSTERS & FIERCE ANIMATIONS\r\nIf you find yourself stuck, fear not! Harness the power of the \"Magic Wand\" to aid your journey. Experience exhilarating animations as you conquer each deal and witness the dragons unleash their fury!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccc<b>HOW TO PLAY</b>\ud83d\udccc\r\n\r\nSave up to 10 game records\r\nChoose between Draw 1 card or Draw 3 cards\r\nConquer levels through single tap or drag&drop moves\r\nEngage in daily challenges with varying difficulty\r\nAutomatically collect cards upon completion\r\nUtilize the Undo feature to rectify mistakes\r\nSeek guidance with the Hint feature\r\nChallenge your speed with Timer mode\r\nAccommodates left-handed players\r\nPlay offline! No need for Wi-Fi\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude1cLove playing solitaire games? Prepare to be enchanted by Solitaire Dragons, <b>the classic solitaire game of your wildest dreams</b>! Download and embark on this legendary adventure <b>NOW</b>!\ud83c\udf89",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udd25 Prepare to be blown away by Solitaire Dragons, the most <b>fiery and legendary</b> solitaire card game in town! Get ready for a thrilling adventure as you embark on a quest to collect a variety of scorching dragons\ud83d\udc09 and create magical habitats for them.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f<b>IGNITE YOUR IMAGINATION</b>\ud83c\udf1f<br><br>\ud83d\udca5EXPLOSIVE SOLITAIRE GAMEPLAY<br>Based on the classic solitaire, we&#39;ve spiced it up with a sizzling twist! Dive into a world of flaming dragons and unlock the unique chest that will leave you breathless!\ud83c\udf81<br><br>\ud83c\udf0bBLAZING DRAGON THEMES<br>While conquering challenging solitaire games, you&#39;ll be transported to a realm of awe-inspiring dragon habitats, filled with majestic creatures and breathtaking landscapes.<br><br>\ud83d\udc32COUNTLESS ADVENTURES AWAIT<br>Prepare yourself for endless excitement with Daily Challenges\ud83c\udccf. Brace yourself for tens of thousands of captivating solitaire challenges, available anytime and anywhere!<br><br>\u2728MAGICAL BOOSTERS &amp; FIERCE ANIMATIONS<br>If you find yourself stuck, fear not! Harness the power of the &quot;Magic Wand&quot; to aid your journey. Experience exhilarating animations as you conquer each deal and witness the dragons unleash their fury!<br><br>\ud83d\udccc<b>HOW TO PLAY</b>\ud83d\udccc<br><br>Save up to 10 game records<br>Choose between Draw 1 card or Draw 3 cards<br>Conquer levels through single tap or drag&amp;drop moves<br>Engage in daily challenges with varying difficulty<br>Automatically collect cards upon completion<br>Utilize the Undo feature to rectify mistakes<br>Seek guidance with the Hint feature<br>Challenge your speed with Timer mode<br>Accommodates left-handed players<br>Play offline! No need for Wi-Fi<br><br>\ud83d\ude1cLove playing solitaire games? Prepare to be enchanted by Solitaire Dragons, <b>the classic solitaire game of your wildest dreams</b>! Download and embark on this legendary adventure <b>NOW</b>!\ud83c\udf89",
